{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Liuri wakes up, alone, deep inside a mine on an abandoned floating island. He doesn\u2019t know how he got there or why. There\u2019s only one thing to do: explore. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tribute to the timeless Sokoban genre, <strong>LABYBAN</strong> modernizes the puzzle game experience with an accessible, intuitive, and stimulating approach. Across more than <strong>140 levels</strong>, each puzzle pushes the gameplay mechanics even further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teleporters, slippery surfaces, conveyor belts... and many more surprises await! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of <strong>LABYBAN</strong> is made up of seven distinct biomes, each with a strong visual identity and unique gameplay mechanics. Some introduce new ways to play, while others combine and transform previous challenges, ensuring a smooth and varied progression. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you manage to escape the island?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3541880?t=1745346797","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541880/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745346797","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541880/a1e60858ba846b45d7de369e746bce1cd0152595/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745346797","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541880/a1e60858ba846b45d7de369e746bce1cd0152595/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745346797","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_d